flowchart TB
  accTitle: Choose a supported path before launching a kernel
  accDescr: Inspect device, dtype, shape and layout before launch. Supported inputs use the registered custom operator and its validated backward. Unsupported inputs take a documented semantics-preserving framework fallback, or fail clearly when no such fallback is supplied.
  A["Check input contract"] --> B["Supported?"]
  B -->|"Yes"| C["Custom op and backward"]
  B -->|"No"| D["Fallback available?"]
  D -->|"Yes"| E["Framework path"]
  D -->|"No"| F["Reject before launch"]
